  case default:
    CoalesceBatchesExec: target_batch_size=8192, fetch=10
      MockSourceExec: partitioning=UnknownPartitioning(3), partition_rows=[200, 0, 400], statistics=Exact
    [invariant] fetch_not_equal_cardinality at CoalesceBatchesExec (root): fetch() is Some(10), but cardinality_effect() is Equal; a fetch can drop input rows, so the effect should be LowerEqual while a fetch is set
