    [invariant] cardinality_effect_holds at CoalesceBatchesExec (root): cardinality_effect() is Equal, but the node produced 20 rows from 600 input rows
    [lint] boundedness_holds at CoalesceBatchesExec (root): rebuilt with child 0 unbounded, the node reports Boundedness::Unbounded, but it has fetch Some(10) and otherwise passes every row through, so like GlobalLimitExec its output ends once the fetch is reached
