## RepartitionExec round robin
  case default:
    RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(4), input_partitions=3
      MockSourceExec: partitioning=UnknownPartitioning(3), partition_rows=[200, 0, 400], statistics=Exact
    [invariant] invalid_partition_errors at RepartitionExec (root): the node has 4 output partitions, but execute(4) returned a stream that panicked when polled: partition not used yet; return an error for a partition at or past the partition count
    [invariant] reset_state_reexecution at RepartitionExec (root): with a second execution of the same plan, without a reset: executing the node panicked: partition not used yet; return an error instead
    [lint] streams_released at RepartitionExec (root): after the output streams were dropped part way, the streams of partitions [0, 1, 2] of child 0 were only dropped once the plan itself was dropped; the plan keeps input streams, or tasks that poll them, alive
  case single partition:
    RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(4), input_partitions=1
