    [lint] limit_pushdown_missed at BufferExec (root): supports_limit_pushdown() is false, but the cardinality effect without a fetch is Equal, maintains_input_order() is true, and each output partition is made of at most one partition of the child, so a limit above the node could be pushed to its child; return true from supports_limit_pushdown, unless an output row depends on later input rows, as in a window function, or the node has side effects on the rows it reads
